      <p class="eyebrow">Causes</p>
      <h1 id="causes-h1">What's heating the planet up</h1>
      <p class="lede">The greenhouse effect is natural, and it's what keeps Earth warm enough to live on. The problem is that human activity has been adding far more greenhouse gas than natural processes can absorb — so more heat gets trapped than usual.</p>

      <div class="greenhouse-wrap">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.2em;">Explore the greenhouse effect</h2>
        <p style="font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:0;">Select each part of the diagram to see what's happening at that stage.</p>
        <div class="greenhouse-grid">
          <div class="gh-svg-box" id="ghSvgBox">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 260" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Diagram of the greenhouse effect showing the sun, atmosphere, Earth's surface and trapped heat">
